#. Skin Element Text: txt-welcome / Text
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Bandar Udara Internasional Radin Inten II, gerbang utama menuju "
"Provinsi Lampung! Terletak di Branti, Natar, sekitar 28 km dari Kota Bandar Lampung, "
"bandara ini menjadi pusat konektivitas udara bagi wisatawan domestik maupun "
"internasional. Dengan desain modern berpadu sentuhan budaya Lampung seperti motif "
"tapis dan siger, bandara ini menghadirkan suasana hangat khas daerah. Nikmati "
"fasilitas lengkap seperti lounge nyaman, area kuliner, dan layanan transportasi "
"menuju berbagai destinasi wisata di Lampung. Radin Inten II Airport bukan sekadar "
"bandara, tetapi pintu awal perjalanan Anda menjelajahi keindahan dan kekayaan budaya "
"Lampung!"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Radin Inten II International Airport, the main gateway to Lampung "
"Province!\n"
"Located in Branti, Natar, about 28 km from Bandar Lampung City, this airport serves "
"as a key air hub for both domestic and international travelers. Combining modern "
"design with local Lampung culture—such as tapis patterns and the iconic siger crown—"
"it offers visitors a warm regional welcome. Enjoy complete facilities including cozy "
"lounges, dining areas, and convenient transport to Lampung’s top destinations. Radin "
"Inten II International Airport is more than just an airport — it’s the beginning of "
"your journey into the natural and cultural wonders of Lampung!"
